  "title": "Put-in-Bay, July 2025",
  "date": "2025-07-12",
  "location": "South Bass Island, Lake Erie",
  "log": "Five days at Put-in-Bay, 12 to 16 July. Rain the first afternoon, then flat water and heat for the rest of it, so the pattern set itself: out of the marina after coffee, round to the swimming spot, back in with Perry’s monument on the bow.\n\nNot a regatta week. The boat did the least work of anyone aboard.",
